# Aquatic Alchemist: only instant and sorcery spells *you* cast count. Turn 3: Bot1 casts Memnite (a creature spell, not
# counted) and Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt at Bot1 (an opponent's instant: no pump, and it does not use up Bot1's "first"),
# so Bot1's Shock afterwards is still the first instant or sorcery spell it cast this turn and pumps the Alchemist to 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Aquatic Alchemist
Memnite
Shock
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

